OL,3,GNEWSANew station puts city at heart of
OL,4,Anetwork - mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new railway station is to be built in
OL,7,FBradford which will put the city at the
OL,8,F"heart" of the Northern Powerhouse
OL,9,FRailway network, the government has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe station, which will replace
OL,13,FBradford Interchange, will be delivered
OL,14,Fin the 2030s and provide improved links
OL,15,Fto Leeds, York and Manchester, a
OL,16,Fspokesperson said.
OL,18,FThe Northern Powerhouse Rail (NPR)
OL,19,Fscheme was first proposed over a decade
OL,20,Fago, but in January the government
OL,21,Fpromised the #45bn plan would go ahead.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
