OL,3,GNEWSANew station puts city at heart of
OL,4,Anetwork - mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor of West Yorkshire Tracy Brabin
OL,7,Fsaid the government's latest
OL,8,Fconfirmation the station would be built
OL,9,Fin the city was an "iron-clad
OL,10,Fcommitment".
